<!--
  Instagram's row in the overlay breakdown panel (D40).

  A GENERIC CAMERA, not Instagram's mark. Deliberately: the panel ships inside a third-party
  app's UI, so a reproduced brand logo is a trademark question we have no reason to open when a
  camera reads just as clearly next to a bar labelled with the count. Geometry is Material
  Icons' `photo_camera` (Apache 2.0). Monochrome and tinted at runtime by BubbleView, so it
  inherits the panel's text colour rather than carrying a colour of its own.

  If official marks are ever wanted here, drop the licensed asset in at this filename — nothing
  else needs to change; PlatformSpec.iconRes already points at it.
-->
